
  prune · dry run, nothing applied
  Prune     feat/bad (merged #7), feat/closed (closed #3), feat/gone (deleted on origin), feat/merged (merged #1), feat/squash (merged #8)
  Kept      feat/dirty (merged #4; dirty), feat/gone-work (deleted on origin; unpushed), feat/locked (merged #5; locked)
  Children  feat/child (left on feat/merged)

  ! feat/dirty is kept: unsafe to remove (dirty)
  ! feat/gone-work is kept: unsafe to remove (unpushed)
  ! feat/locked is kept: unsafe to remove (locked)

  fingerprint  <FP>
  → wtm prune --expect-fingerprint <FP>   apply this plan
  → wtm prune feat/dirty feat/gone-work feat/locked --force   prune them anyway

